# Force a single-hop redirect straight to the canonical https+www URL,
# instead of Netlify's default two-hop behavior (bare-http apex -> https
# apex -> https www) for any non-canonical entry point.
http://timmacdonoughpainting.com/*   https://www.timmacdonoughpainting.com/:splat   301!
https://timmacdonoughpainting.com/*  https://www.timmacdonoughpainting.com/:splat   301!
